OL,7,     Fa powerful emotional impact.
OL,8,G1215 Profile
OL,9,     FActress, comedian, writer, best
OL,10,     Fknown for her portrayal of the
OL,11,     Fill-informed, fictional TV
OL,12,     Fpresenter Philomena Cunk, who
OL,13,     Freturns to our screens this coming
OL,14,     Fweek.
OL,15,G1230 Room 101 with Paul Merton
OL,16,     F4/6. Andi Osho tells Paul Merton
OL,17,     Fher pet peeves - including small
OL,18,     Ftalk, estate agents' tricks and
OL,19,     Fhotel rooms.
